OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain,
OL,7,Fcontinuing into the early hours of
OL,8,FFriday. Feeling much milder than last
OL,9,Fnight with winds turning westerly in
OL,10,Fdirection. These winds strengthening
OL,11,Finto the early hours of Friday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FRain with blustery winds
OL,14,Fbefore clearing into the evening with
OL,15,Fwinds easing. A few brighter spells on
OL,16,Foffer for the remainder of the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
