OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FA
OL,6,Fchilly start on Saturday, with
OL,7,Fscattered showers, easing into Sunday
OL,8,Falongside winds allowing for sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Cloud building into Monday,
OL,10,Fturning milder, with a chance for
OL,11,Fdrizzly rain.
